{"id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-yoneda-embedding.md","title":"Definition — Yoneda Embedding","display":"Definition — Yoneda Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","aliases":["14-df-yoneda-embedding"],"display":"Definition — Yoneda Embedding","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-yoneda-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-yoneda-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Yoneda Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴。预层范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}=(y_0,y_1)\">\\(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}=(y_0,y_1)\\)</span> 是候选函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_0(A)=(y_0(A)_0,y_0(A)_1)\">\\(y_0(A)=(y_0(A)_0,y_0(A)_1)\\)</span>。自然变换分量采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a> 的有类型记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ (y_0(A)(X)=\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,X)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\n(y_0(A)(g)(h)=h\\circ g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\n(y_1(f)_X(h)=f\\circ h).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ (y_0(A)(X)=\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,X)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\n(y_0(A)(g)(h)=h\\circ g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\n(y_1(f)_X(h)=f\\circ h).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.1，印刷页 26–27。必须同时给出表示预层对源箭头的前合成作用和 Yoneda 函子对目标箭头的后合成作用。仅规定各点的底集不足以决定表示预层，旧定义允许错误的作用。结合律保证两者的自然性与函子性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴。预层范畴 $\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[14-df-presheaf-category]]。$\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}=(y_0,y_1)$ 是候选函子；$y_0(A)=(y_0(A)_0,y_0(A)_1)$。自然变换分量采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的有类型记号。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴。预层范畴 $\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[14-df-presheaf-category]]。$\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}=(y_0,y_1)$ 是候选函子；$y_0(A)=(y_0(A)_0,y_0(A)_1)$。自然变换分量采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的有类型记号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}=(y_0,y_1)","display":false},{"tex":"y_0(A)=(y_0(A)_0,y_0(A)_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ (y_0(A)(X)=\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,X)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\n(y_0(A)(g)(h)=h\\circ g)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\n(y_1(f)_X(h)=f\\circ h).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1645,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding|Definition — Yoneda Embedding]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]"},{"id":"a56025295f88eafd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})$ (Yoneda embedding, see [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]])"},{"id":"e213602dd9109075","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]"},{"id":"573e576a0d47c877","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding|Definition — Yoneda Embedding]]"},{"id":"8e2ae868c0cc48ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3d83677380a58c7f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$I\\in\\mathcal U$，$C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$，$(f_i:C_i\\to C)_{i\\in I}$ 为箭头族。$y$ 是[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]的 Yoneda 函子，$P=\\coprod_{i\\in I}y(C_i)$ 为[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers]]的带标签预层余积，所以 $P(D)=\\{(i,h)\\mid i\\in I,\\ h:D\\to C_i\\}$。$(a,\\eta)$ 是[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]的层化函子。$R_{\\boldsymbol f}$ 为此族生成的筛，$q_{\\boldsymbol f}$ 是下式构造的自然变换；满态射在层范畴中解释。"},{"id":"1895c20f7dacd11c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"717547fac08fc31f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"769638b12e2bdfd0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a83339712ea1a677","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca489e8e614e025a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$\\mathcal E=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$，$i:\\mathcal E\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 为满包含。选取满足 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]] 的 $\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$ 的数据；$y$ 是 [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]] 的 Yoneda 函子，Yoneda 对应采用 [[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]。层的有限积采用逐点积，终层逐点为固定单元素集；这是 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 的构造在层上的限制。"},{"id":"cf0fb3021021d3e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$y=\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}$ 满足 [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]。完全忠实见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。"},{"id":"1291f8efcdef81cf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})$ (Yoneda embedding, see [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]])"}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","1bdaf4a293143165","5c5452002ba29fda"]}